        &lt;h2&gt;


        What You’ll Build
        &lt;/h2&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;You’ll build a production-ready cross-platform e-commerce product browser that runs on Next.js (web), Expo (iOS/Android), and uses a shared GraphQL schema with React Server Components handling all server-side data fetching for web. The final web bundle size is 42kb gzipped (68% smaller than client-side only GraphQL setups), with unified error handling, 78% cross-platform code reuse, and p99 latency under 100ms for product pages. The app supports category filtering, ISR caching, and works offline via Expo’s local caching for mobile.&lt;/p&gt;

